[[File:Starwalker Bird (Beta 49.0).png|thumb|295x295px|Beta 49.0]]
'''Beta 30.0''' released this card with 3/3 for 5G with Haste and Ranged. '''Beta 31.0''' gave it -1 HP. This was reverted in '''Beta 32.1''', but instead increased its cost from 5G to 6G. '''Beta 34.0''' added the ability to deal 1 DMG to a random enemy monster whenever it attacks and kills a monster.

'''Beta 47.0''' removed Ranged, which caused this to get redesigned. It gained +2/+2 and now has a Magic effect that requires your deck to lack any Rare and Epic monsters (something also given to the redesigned [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Ranger_Rudinn Ranger Rudinn]). In this case, if you lack them, all monsters in your hand gain +1/+1. '''Beta 49.0''' changed that to letting you draw 3 cards. ([https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Final_Froggit Final Froggit] and [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Ponman Dark Ponman] were also made Rare to not be as easily used with this.) '''Beta 53.0''' gave it the same treatment as [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Gerson_Tombstone Gerson Tombstone]: Generated cards, cards that didn't start in your deck (shown with a Gear Icon), that are in your deck no longer count.
